{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ToolInputResponse = \n  | {\n  payload: unknown;\n  status: \"resolved\";\n}\n  | {\n  status: \"cancelled\";\n};","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L761","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:761"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The user's answer to an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mcp_input"},{"type":"text","value":" interrupt.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"resolved"},{"type":"text","value":" carries the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"payload"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"resolveInterrupt"},{"type":"text","value":".\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cancelled"},{"type":"text","value":" means the user called "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cancel()"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ToolInputResponse = \n  | {\n  payload: unknown;\n  status: \"resolved\";\n}\n  | {\n  status: \"cancelled\";\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:761](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L761)\n\nThe user's answer to an `mcp_input` interrupt.\n`resolved` carries the `payload` from `resolveInterrupt`.\n`cancelled` means the user called `cancel()`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ToolInputResponse\ntitle: ToolInputResponse\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ToolInputResponse = \n  | {\n  payload: unknown;\n  status: \"resolved\";\n}\n  | {\n  status: \"cancelled\";\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:761](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L761)\n\nThe user's answer to an `mcp_input` interrupt.\n`resolved` carries the `payload` from `resolveInterrupt`.\n`cancelled` means the user called `cancel()`.\n"}
